{"5072430":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Ghost in the SQL Data","steam_appid":5072430,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/f44a4a8ee532320b1f91309e4c6bca6d.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/f44a4a8ee532320b1f91309e4c6bca6d.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=571 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/4780ff075b177d10fa77004c255c58b0.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/4780ff075b177d10fa77004c255c58b0.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=401 \/><\/span>Here is a case. Use SQL to search a year of calls to the Paris Emergency Switchboard. Find who called 14 minutes before the first witness saw the school on fire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/f7e7213d563cfd5058514fae224a77a3.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/f7e7213d563cfd5058514fae224a77a3.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=457 \/><\/span>Use SQL to explore the data, filter it and join the tables. The first cases teach you the basics, and the later ones only give you the question.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/e483eeae3c28ddec622c6c49b6c8d118.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/e483eeae3c28ddec622c6c49b6c8d118.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=368 \/><\/span>Use an investigator’s board to pin your results, their charts and your notes, then connect the clues to solve the case.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/75df26b2bf49db3684491b2d31b142e7.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/75df26b2bf49db3684491b2d31b142e7.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=373 \/><\/span>Every case takes place in Paris: a school fire, a metro ticket with no name, or even a crown stolen from the Musée d’Orsay!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/f44a4a8ee532320b1f91309e4c6bca6d.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/f44a4a8ee532320b1f91309e4c6bca6d.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=571 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/4780ff075b177d10fa77004c255c58b0.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/4780ff075b177d10fa77004c255c58b0.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=401 \/><\/span>Here is a case. Use SQL to search a year of calls to the Paris Emergency Switchboard. Find who called 14 minutes before the first witness saw the school on fire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/f7e7213d563cfd5058514fae224a77a3.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/f7e7213d563cfd5058514fae224a77a3.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=457 \/><\/span>Use SQL to explore the data, filter it and join the tables. The first cases teach you the basics, and the later ones only give you the question.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/e483eeae3c28ddec622c6c49b6c8d118.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/e483eeae3c28ddec622c6c49b6c8d118.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=368 \/><\/span>Use an investigator’s board to pin your results, their charts and your notes, then connect the clues to solve the case.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras\/75df26b2bf49db3684491b2d31b142e7.avif?t=1793701208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/extras_big\/75df26b2bf49db3684491b2d31b142e7.webp?t=1793701208 width=1560 height=373 \/><\/span>Every case takes place in Paris: a school fire, a metro ticket with no name, or even a crown stolen from the Musée d’Orsay!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A call reported a school fire 14 minutes before the first witness saw it. Find out who made it, in SQL, by exploring a year of Paris emergency calls.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Italian<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","reviews":"“An unusual mystery game that developers will get hooked on.”<br>ITmedia @IT<br><br>“A mystery game where you uncover the truth of a case with SQL. It looks fun.”<br>Denfaminicogamer<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/51f9c7715c2f874443595ae9e76269b02444c496\/header.jpg?t=1793701208","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/68f0d273de2d8da9c13f6cf314089ec320eb377d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793701208","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5072430\/68f0d273de2d8da9c13f6cf314089ec320eb377d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793701208","website":"https:\/\/isaacmenard.github.io\/presskit\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual Core 2,0 GHz (Intel Core i3)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 (support WebGL \/ DirectX 11)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad Core 2,5 GHz or more<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GPU (Intel Iris Xe \/ AMD Vega 8)<br><\/li><li>